                mouse_layer {
                        display-name = "MOUSE";
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// |            |       |            |             |             |            |                                                    |                 |       MB4       |       MB5     |                  |       |       |
// |     LHYPER |       |      LGUI  |        LALT |       LSHFT | LCTRL      |                                                    |       MOVE_LEFT |       MOVE_DOWN |       MOVE_UP |       MOVE_RIGHT |       |       |
// |     LMEH   |       |      RGUI  |        RALT |       RSHFT | RCTRL      |                                                    |       SCRL_LEFT |       SCRL_DOWN |       SCRL_UP |       SCRL_RIGHT |       |       |      
